Verdict: changes requested for **TASK-260720-3pwg2w — Protect and publish immutable build cache entries**. Routed to `to-dev`.

Windows DACL validation ignores deny ACEs and inherit-only flags, so it can trust entries where the owner lacks effective mutation rights. Windows evaluates ACE applicability and ordering; see [Microsoft’s DACL documentation](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/secauthz/dacls-and-aces).

All native, race, candidate, cross-compile, formatting, and vet gates passed. Windows runtime tests were unavailable locally.

Full evidence and required rework: [TASK-260720-3pwg2w_review-verdict.md](/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/curator/.task-board/.resources/TASK-260720-3pwg2w/TASK-260720-3pwg2w_review-verdict.md).
